    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 27 • Firing Somebody",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Kurt has the difficult task of firing Dan. Dan's been with the company since the beginning and is a friend of Kurt's. Dan is surprised and upset with the news."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Dan, "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "your work has slipped"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". You've been here for 15 years, and I think you're just "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "burned out"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Dan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "What are you talking about? I'm "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "at the top of my game"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". I just managed our biggest project in years."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "You can't "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "take credit for"
                },
                {
                  "text": " that. You "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "didn't lift a finger"
                },
                {
                  "text": " on that project. You were on vacation in Hawaii for three weeks while Steve and Sally were doing all the work."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Dan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I'm not good at "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"reading between the lines"
                },
                {
                  "text":	". Please just "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "cut to the chase"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". What are you trying to say?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Dan, Swift Shoes is downsizing. This is really difficult, but we're going to have to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "let you go"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Dan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "What? I helped "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "build this company from the ground up"
                },
                {
                  "text": "! You can't fire me now."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I don't want to, but "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "my hands are tied"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Our president has told me to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "reduce headcount"
                },
                {
                  "text": " by 50 percent."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Dan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I thought you and I were friends, but when "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "push comes to shove"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", I guess our friendship isn't worth anything."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Of course we're still friends, but business is business."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Dan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I don't agree with that. I would never fire a friend...after all those times Kathleen and I invited you and Donna to dinner at our home!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Dan, I want you to leave Swift Shoes on friendly terms. "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "No hard feelings"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "To soften the blow"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", we're going to give you a generous severance package.*"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "*severance package - the benefits offered to an employee being laid off"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
